00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:31.000
And this includes you and me, in this line, to different degrees.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:38.000
Let's say, here are the least agreeable with Satan, and these are the most espouse-agreeable with Satan.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:45.000
God gave these creatures a second chance. First of all, the angels said "since these creatures here rebelled, put them all in Hell."

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.000
"Throw them all in Hell. Banish them from Your Kingdom."

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:52.000
And in Sura 2, verse 30, God says, no.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:55.000
One of the names of God is the Most Merciful.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:02.000
God wanted to give us another chance to reconsider our decision to side with Satan.

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:06.000
In Sura 2, verse 30, God says,

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:07.000
[2:30] ... "I know what you do not know."

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:10.000
The angels said "throw them all in Hell", and God said,

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:11.000
[2:30] ... "I know what you do not know."

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:15.000
What did God know that the angels didn't know?

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:19.000
God knew that some of us, deep in our hearts, we really believed in God's absolute authority.

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:25.000
Dr. Khalifa: But for some reasons, we were swept in the crowd, and we agreed with Satan, to different degrees.

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:26.000
A man: (unintelligible)

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:27.000
Dr. Khalifa: So,... Pardon?

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:33.000
So, this line here, representing the rebels, God gave them a second chance.

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:38.000
He said, how do you like to reconsider your agreement with Satan?

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:45.000
I'm going to give you a chance to submit outright, or you can go through an experiment where we put Satan to the test.

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:50.000
And I used the example of, for example, Mohammad (unintelligible) said, I can fly a plane.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:52.000
He's making a claim.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:57.000
The best way to test his claim, is to give him a plane and say "fly it."

00:22:57.000 --> 00:22:59.000
And this is what God did with Satan.

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:04.000
Satan said "I can be a god", and God said, okay, I'm gonna make you a god, and see if you can do it.

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:10.000
This is how we can test, test Satan's claim.

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:13.000
So, God was giving these rebels a choice.

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:22.000
He said, you either submit outright, denounce your rebellion, here, and submit to God's absolute authority,

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:26.000
or you can go through an experiment and witness Satan trying to be a god.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:34.000
Okay, the vast majority of these creatures, the vast, vast majority, as you agree with me,

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:39.000
took advantage of this offer, and decided to submit to God outright.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:44.000
They submit to God's absolute authority.

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:55.000
So, I'm going to represent the, the hardcore rebels, which, unfortunately, include you and me, by a small dark tier.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:06.000
The vast majority of the rebels reconsidered this decision, and submitted outright to God.

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:17.000
And this includes the animals, the mountains, the trees, the stars, and we read it very clearly in the Quran.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:23.000
I'll just give you an example of one verse, 55:6, Sura 55, verse 6.

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:26.000
Dr. Khalifa: And if you read it loud to us, it will give us an idea.

00:24:36.000 --> 00:24:39.000
A woman: [55:6] The stars and the trees prostrate.

00:24:39.000 --> 00:24:41.000
Dr. Khalifa: [55:6] The stars and the trees prostrate.

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:45.000
The stars, you can look up and see them, and the trees.

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:52.000
So, these are creatures of God who have submitted to God. They are doing their job without any deviation.

00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:58.000
And again, for some of you, it's repetitious, but excuse me, but for the sake of the new people,

00:24:58.000 --> 00:25:04.000
who didn't hear this before, the sun, for example, will rise and set tomorrow at precisely the times prescribed to it by God.

00:25:06.000 --> 00:25:11.000
And you can see it in the newspaper, to the second, what time the sun will rise, what time it is going to set.

00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:15.000
The moon phases follow the exact precise precision.

00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:23.000
Well, the moon is rotating around itself and around the earth in a synchronized rotation, so we never see the other side of the moon.

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:30.000
If that rotation was off by a second, a fraction of a second, we would see the other side of the moon. We never do.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:35.000
Because of the synchronized precision of the moon going around the earth and around itself.

00:25:38.000 --> 00:25:42.000
Okay, so these creatures here made an agreement with God.

00:25:42.000 --> 00:25:52.000
They said "we will go to that experiment of Satan trying to fly his plane, trying to be a god, we will go participate in that experiment as submitters.

00:25:55.000 --> 00:25:59.000
And again, I use the example of the horse and the dog, for example.

00:25:59.000 --> 00:26:02.000
The horse will let anybody ride him.

00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:08.000
I have to back up a little bit and say that the initiation of the whole problem,

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:15.000
which is told in the Quran as the great feud, it is in Sura 38, verse 69.

00:26:16.000 --> 00:26:21.000
The initiation of the whole problem was because of the ego. Satan had an ego.

00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:28.000
He thought out of ignorance and out of the ego that he can be a god besides God,

00:26:28.000 --> 00:26:31.000
that he can run a dominion and keep it perfectly happy.

00:26:32.000 --> 00:26:38.000
No accidents, no earthquakes, no diseases, no divorce, no traffic tickets, no headaches.

00:26:39.000 --> 00:26:40.000
He thought he can do that.

00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:45.000
And the creatures that agreed with him also had an ego problem.

00:26:45.000 --> 00:26:48.000
These are the egotistic creatures of God.

00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:53.000
We can also deal, if we have time, we'll deal with the issue of why did God create these creatures to rebel?

00:26:53.000 --> 00:26:57.000
Because God knew, of course, that among these creatures, some would rebel.

00:26:57.000 --> 00:27:01.000
But that will be another subject, probably, that we cannot get to it tonight.

00:27:03.000 --> 00:27:05.000
The horse has no ego.

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:13.000
When these creatures took advantage of God's offer, which we see in Sura 33, verse 72,

00:27:13.000 --> 00:27:21.000
the second offer to denounce our crime, this is the original sin, that you and I committed, billions of years ago.

00:27:22.000 --> 00:27:27.000
And these creatures, they realized their crime and they are ready to pay for it.

00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:32.000
And in Sura 2, verse 54, we see a commandment to kill our ego.

00:27:33.000 --> 00:27:40.000
Because we refused. When God told you and me, you're gonna go down to the earth as a dog, we said "no way."

00:27:40.000 --> 00:27:41.000
Well, we have an ego.

00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:44.000
You and I, we have an ego. We said "no."

00:27:44.000 --> 00:27:50.000
We know, "we're gonna go as humans and we're gonna take the test. And I'm so smart, I'm going to make the right choice."

00:27:50.000 --> 00:27:51.000
This is what you and I said.

00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:55.000
We refused to come here as dogs or horses or cats or mice.

00:27:57.000 --> 00:28:02.000
So, the horse comes here, lets anybody ride him,

00:28:02.000 --> 00:28:06.000
whether that person is rich or poor or tall or short or handsome or ugly,

00:28:06.000 --> 00:28:10.000
we ride the horse and the horse will obediently do the job.

00:28:10.000 --> 00:28:14.000
"And we'll live here 10 to 20 years and then go on, redeemed to God's kingdom."

00:28:14.000 --> 00:28:16.000
That was the horse's choice.

00:28:17.000 --> 00:28:21.000
Sura 38... Sura 6, verse 38,

00:28:21.000 --> 00:28:26.000
It says, all these creatures, birds flying are communities like you, that will be gathered before God on the Day of Judgement.

00:28:26.000 --> 00:28:28.000
They go to the lower Heaven.

00:28:29.000 --> 00:28:34.000
The human being, this is one incentive that caused us to not to do that.

00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:42.000
A human being that makes a choice to uphold God's absolute authority,

00:28:42.000 --> 00:28:48.000
and believes that Muhammad has no power, Jesus has no power, Mary has no power, the saints have no power,

00:28:48.000 --> 00:28:50.000
nobody else has any power except God.

00:28:51.000 --> 00:28:53.000
That person makes it to the High Heaven.

00:28:53.000 --> 00:28:57.000
And there's a big difference between the High Heaven and the Low Heaven as you see in the Quran.

00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:02.000
So, these creatures include the horses, the cats, the dogs, the stars.

00:29:03.000 --> 00:29:06.000
The stars are mainly there because there are so many of them.

00:29:08.000 --> 00:29:12.000
If they, if they were animals and lived on this earth, we'd have no room for us.

00:29:13.000 --> 00:29:22.000
Or in that case, in the bigger earth, it will not be as, as easy for us to travel from Iran or Egypt to the States, for example. It would be a huge planet,

00:29:22.000 --> 00:29:29.000
in order to accommodate all those creatures. There is a billion, trillion stars out there, all in precise orbits,

00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:32.000
besides, uncountless decillions of heavenly bodies.

00:29:33.000 --> 00:29:36.000
I think all of you remember Halley's Comet.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:44.000
It comes to our solar system every 76 years, counting 1, 2, 3, up to 76, which is 19 times 4 by the way.

00:29:45.000 --> 00:29:51.000
We know exactly when it will come. We knew it was coming in 198.., what was it, 6? Which is 1985, 86.

00:29:51.000 --> 00:29:55.000
And we wait for it. And sure enough, here it comes. 76 years.

00:29:56.000 --> 00:29:59.000
And then, it leaves. And we know exactly when it will come back. It is following God's law.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:05.000
So, all those heavenly bodies, stars, sun, the moon, and so on. They are following God's law.

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:09.000
But the reason they're up there is because there's no room for them down here on the planet earth.

00:30:09.000 --> 00:30:11.000
So, God put them there to adorn the sky.

00:30:11.000 --> 00:30:19.000
They are doing their function, and then will be redeemed to God's kingdom after doing the submissive role.

00:30:23.000 --> 00:30:26.000
Okay, so this tells us how bad we are.

00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:31.000
Because over here we sided with Satan.

00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:34.000
We were given a second chance and again we sided with Satan.

00:30:34.000 --> 00:30:37.000
We said "we'd like to see what he's gonna do. Maybe, he can do it."

00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:40.000
Which means we doubted God's absolute authority.

00:30:40.000 --> 00:30:42.000
We doubted God's word.

00:30:42.000 --> 00:30:44.000
Because God said, nobody can do it.

00:30:44.000 --> 00:30:50.000
And this is not egotistic on God's part. God is not egotistic.

00:30:50.000 --> 00:30:54.000
He simply, God knows that only He can run a dominion perfectly.

00:30:55.000 --> 00:30:58.000
And this is the distinction that happens now.

00:30:59.000 --> 00:31:01.000
Dr. Khalifa: The people who joined God's...

00:31:02.000 --> 00:31:08.000
Dr. Khalifa: ... in the past. Remember the great feud, or what Satan told us in the past and what God told us,

00:31:08.000 --> 00:31:10.000
and what our comrades told us.

00:31:11.000 --> 00:31:15.000
So, we're coming here with a fresh start and we're getting the message, God's message and Satan's message.

00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:18.000
And we are making a choice.

00:31:18.000 --> 00:31:23.000
So, this is a final chance for us to denounce that original sin, and go back to God.

00:31:24.000 --> 00:31:27.000
But like I said, the rule is we are rebels.

00:31:28.000 --> 00:31:30.000
The human beings are rebels.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:39.000
And the natural tendency would be to continue to uphold that opinion that you had in the past that God alone is not enough,

00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:42.000
that God is not the only solver.

00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:44.000
This is what we, this is why we are here.

00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:48.000
Dr. Khalifa: Are there any other questions on the first, first part?

