A man: Now, for him to be going to a purgatory,

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:28.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:33.000
A man: it is totally unfair. And I don't think God is unjust. Dr. Khalifa: So, first of all

00:35:33.000 --> 00:35:35.000
Dr. Khalifa: Okay, first of all he's not innocent.

00:35:35.000 --> 00:35:40.000
Because we are here in the first place because we committed that crime, the original sin. You and I were not innocent when we were born.

00:35:41.000 --> 00:35:44.000
Dr. Khalifa: Further, we have that crime that we committed, you see.

00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:49.000
A man: What about the things you mentioned? You mentioned that he has been given a second chance

00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:49.000
Dr. Khalifa: Right.

