Dr. Khalifa: We refused that. And we continued A man: Yeah.

00:35:57.000 --> 00:35:58.000
Dr. Khalifa: to be a hardcore rebel. A man: Yeah.

00:35:58.000 --> 00:36:01.000
A man: And this person wants to (unintelligible) Dr. Khalifa: So, (unintelligible) giving us... Yes.

00:36:01.000 --> 00:36:04.000
Dr. Khalifa: There's other person in the desert somewhere who never heard any of this, right? A man: Yes.

