Dr. Khalifa: Even that person is born with God's message, and Satan's message.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:09.000
A man: Yes.

00:36:09.000 --> 00:36:12.000
Dr. Khalifa: And we have an example in the Quran of that person. His name is Abraham.

00:36:13.000 --> 00:36:17.000
He's out in the desert and he looked at the sky and he looked at the sun and the moon.

00:36:17.000 --> 00:36:19.000
He looked around him and he discovered God

00:36:19.000 --> 00:36:23.000
without any book, without any messenger, without anything.

00:36:23.000 --> 00:36:26.000
He was just out in the desert. Because we have this natural instinct in us.

00:36:28.000 --> 00:36:30.000
If you ask yourself, why are you here? Why are you so interested?

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:34.000
It's because there's an instinct in you that you want to search.

00:36:35.000 --> 00:36:38.000
Dr. Khalifa: There's an instinct in you and in me to search for our Creator.

00:36:38.000 --> 00:36:42.000
A man: Yeah, but that's provided that instinct has been placed in someone.

