A man: How about them? Dr. Khalifa: No, no.

00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:52.000
Dr. Khalifa: There's not any human being whose this part is missing.

00:36:52.000 --> 00:36:54.000
But God said, I mentioned it earlier.

00:36:54.000 --> 00:37:01.000
God gathered all the descendants of Adam and put that instinct in them.

00:37:02.000 --> 00:37:07.000
You know, the bird lays the eggs and sits on the eggs until they hatch.

00:37:07.000 --> 00:37:11.000
She keeps those eggs at a constant temperature until they hatch.

00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:18.000
And then the little babies come out of the eggs and she goes out, (unintelligible) and feeds those babies.

00:37:18.000 --> 00:37:22.000
